'''Henry''' is a monster added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]'' DLC and is exclusively found in {{s|Dross}}.

Henry appears only in a single extremely rare room within the floor. When Isaac enters the room, Henry smiles and then gets flushed down a drain. Isaac can fire tears at him, but due to his high HP he is extremely difficult to kill, and this would be pointless anyway as his only behavior is killing himself.

== Notes ==
* {{i|Friendly Ball}} can be used to capture Henry, although when released he will still flush himself, doing no damage to enemies. Henry also does not spawn properly if the room lacks a pit.
* Although Henry does not attack Isaac directly, he can still deal contact damage if the player has flight.
** Henry does not have his own kill icon, so if Isaac somehow manages to die from him, the death screen will instead show a [[Rocks#Buckets|bucket]] as the cause of death.
* Henry does not appear in the game's [[Bestiary]], and as such, does not need to be killed to complete it.
* The room in which Henry spawns has an id of 485 and has a weight of 0.01. The rarity is further compounded by the room requiring a dead end with only a south exit, and as such cannot be generated by {{i|Red Key}}.
* Using {{i|Flush!}} on Henry will not flush him, instead turning him into a poop.

